\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-8584/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f91a9eef-3fd6-51e3-9aeb-a15bf883efcb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-8584/selection/316d954020a63455cefc7f36aad7242db039fd6b2ef9bc76a1643718eaa5b624" :answer-field/choices ["q-8584/selection/e3eabab7458d610dcf2c458d57f3d8b73a0c41c86bf1880902b662f4f5a29e61" "q-8584/selection/0ee23654204b8f3566af5e97fd31f3569d938c6b02036cca0ea70b2ea7cfd52b" "q-8584/selection/5c8d9f38cbb0b58ea9b123dfb4511374d9b4fe61bcdfe6aaf10ada784bb1375c" "q-8584/selection/316d954020a63455cefc7f36aad7242db039fd6b2ef9bc76a1643718eaa5b624" "q-8584/selection/c3e23fc914c4210f071be05f616653381c056f8c1f0f49955fd522899cf52d7a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-8584" :question/id #uuid "deece767-a8b1-50ea-a073-5f4486558542" :question/math-academy-id "q-8584" :question/problem "Construct the matrix of the linear transformation that acts on a vector in ${R}^{2}$ as follows (in the order given):\n\n- it rotates the vector by $\\frac{3\\pi }{2}$ radians counterclockwise about the origin, and then\n\n- applies a shear transformation to the result with a shear factor of $3$ parallel to the $x$-axis." :question/worked-solution "Let $P$ be the matrix that represents the rotation and let $Q$ be the matrix that represents the shear. These are given by the following elementary transformation matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2}) & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2}) \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2}) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ Q & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the combined transformation can be represented by the matrix $QP:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}QP & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-8584/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ad47b548-a298-5cc9-8f69-70fee292db5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8584"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "d049b3ad-3389-57d7-a145-3264887eb06b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "0078dd3f-fb0c-5451-8be0-7093c77e20f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f6b2d98-3768-5ad1-994d-8380e873cbea" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-279646/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-279646/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-279646/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-2/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9" :answer/id #uuid "da4d61ed-5c7e-5fcf-92c1-01d6f2fa8d12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "33ea522d-4aa4-5e6c-a530-6e0261c5d576" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-279646/field-2/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9" :answer-field/choices ["q-279646/field-2/73eeaf3fae024b54005d89a5185040ad67cf4b6c72d401d6ad32bf0e79c13de9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-279646/field-3/a